  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "You there! Young <U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿЃmanlady! Please, can you spare a\nminute?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F0075002000740068006500720065002100200059006F0075006E0067002000100003110000FF0403006D0061006E006C006100640079002100200050006C0065006100730065002C002000630061006E00200079006F007500200073007000610072006500200061000A006D0069006E007500740065003F00100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ve embarked on a new business venture here,\nbut I have to admit that it’s not going very well.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You see, I aim to help those who suffer from bad\ndreams catch up on their Z’s...through the power<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nof hypnosis!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 118
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I think plenty of us are plagued with bad dreams\nthese days, don’t you?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But I’ve run into quite the roadblock!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00420075007400200049201900760065002000720075006E00200069006E0074006F002000710075006900740065002000740068006500200072006F006100640062006C006F0063006B002100100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "My first customer’s Flamigo simply refuses to fall\nasleep!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D007900200066006900720073007400200063007500730074006F006D006500722019007300200046006C0061006D00690067006F002000730069006D0070006C00790020007200650066007500730065007300200074006F002000660061006C006C000A00610073006C006500650070002100100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Flam?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0046006C0061006D003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "My Flamigo just flat-out won’t drift off. Perhaps\nthere’s too much energy stored up in its belly?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƼ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Muuu...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D007500750075002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I think Musharna might also be experiencing\nsome jitters in front of our very first customer.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please! Could you give Musharna a nice example?\nShow it how easy it can be?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "All you have to do is use <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Hypnosis<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> and then\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Dream Eater<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> on Flamigo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 14,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please, use the moves <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Hypnosis <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>and <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Dream Eater<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>\non this Flamigo here!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 14,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Muuu...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D007500750075002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I only want to help my Flamigo sleep... The poor\nthing’s been up for three straight days and nights!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƼ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Flam.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0046006C0061006D002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "First, hit it with a good <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Hypnosis<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00460069007200730074002C0020006800690074002000690074002000770069007400680020006100200067006F006F0064002000100002FF000006004800790070006E006F00730069007300100002FF000000002100100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh! You did it—Flamigo is asleep! Now all we\nneed is a good <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Dream Eater<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please use the move <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Dream Eater<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> on it next!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006C0065006100730065002000750073006500200074006800650020006D006F00760065002000100002FF0000060044007200650061006D00200045006100740065007200100002FF0000000020006F006E0020006900740020006E006500780074002100100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yes! That was a fine Dream Eater!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005900650073002100200054006800610074002000770061007300200061002000660069006E006500200044007200650061006D002000450061007400650072002100100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Flamigo is snoozing like a baby...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0046006C0061006D00690067006F00200069007300200073006E006F006F007A0069006E00670020006C0069006B00650020006100200062006100620079002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thank you very much for helping my poor\ninsomniac Flamigo get some rest!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƼ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Flam. ♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0046006C0061006D002E0020266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It seems to be feeling better now that it got some\nmuch-needed shut-eye.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI’m sure we’ll be back the next time Flamigo has\ntrouble sleeping!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƼ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 147
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That was a fine demonstration. Surely Musharna\nis ready for any future customers now!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Shashasha! ♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530068006100730068006100730068006100210020266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thank you for your help! Now my dream business,\nRêve de Musharna, will be a grand success!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If you ever think that any of your Pokémon need\nsome sleep, please bring them to me.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 29,
